"</imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av undermenyn Markera.</phrase> "
"</textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:956
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>All</guimenuitem> item provides a quick way to select the "
"entire worksheet."
msgstr ""
"Med <guimenuitem>Allt</guimenuitem> kan du snabbt markera hela kalkylbladet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:963
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Row</guimenuitem> and <guimenuitem>Column </guimenuitem> "
"items allow the user to select all the rows or columns spanned by the "
"current selection."
msgstr ""
"Med <guimenuitem>Rad</guimenuitem> och <guimenuitem>Kolumn </guimenuitem> "
"markerar du alla rader eller kolumner som den aktuella markeringen omfattar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:972
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Array</guimenuitem> menu item allows a user to select all "
"the cells which are part of the same array as the current cell."
msgstr ""
"Menyobjektet <guimenuitem>Matris</guimenuitem> markerar alla celler som "
"ingår i samma matris som den aktuella cellen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:980
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Depends </guimenuitem> menu item selects all the cells "
"which contain formula that reference data in the current cell."
msgstr ""
"Menyobjektet <guimenuitem>Beroenden </guimenuitem> markerar alla celler med "
"formler som refererar till data i den aktuella cellen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:989
msgid ""
"Similarly, the <guimenuitem>Inputs </guimenuitem> menu item selects all the "
"cells whose data is referenced by the formula in the current cell."
msgstr ""
"På samma sätt markerar menyobjektet <guimenuitem>Indata </guimenuitem> alla "
"celler vars data refereras av formeln i den aktuella cellen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:998
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Next Object </guimenuitem> menu item selects the next sheet"
" object on the current sheet. If no object is selected it will select the "
"object locate at the front."
msgstr ""
"Menyobjektet <guimenuitem>Nästa objekt </guimenuitem> markerar nästa objekt "
"på det aktuella kalkylbladet. Om inget objekt är markerat väljs det objekt "
"som ligger längst fram."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1008
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Go to Top</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Go to "
"Bottom</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Go to the First</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>Go to the Last</guimenuitem>, menu items move the selection "
"within a rectangular block of data cells. the front."
msgstr ""
"Menyobjekten <guimenuitem>Gå till toppen</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Gå till"
" botten</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Gå till första</guimenuitem> och "
"<guimenuitem>Gå till sista</guimenuitem> flyttar markeringen inom ett "
"rektangulärt block med dataceller."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1019
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Goto cell...</guimenuitem> — The <guimenuitem>Goto "
"cell...</guimenuitem> menu item opens up a dialog which allows the user to "
"type the name or address of a cell in the worksheet. The current view will "
"then change to ensure that the selected cell is in the current view and the "
"selection will cover that cell."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Gå till cell…</guimenuitem> — Menyobjektet <guimenuitem>Gå till"
" cell…</guimenuitem> öppnar en dialogruta där du kan skriva namnet på eller "
"adressen till en cell i kalkylbladet. Vyn ändras så att cellen visas och "
"markeringen omfattar den."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1033
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Recalculate</guimenuitem> — The "
"<guimenuitem>Recalculate</guimenuitem> menu item forces the workbook to "
"recalculate its results. This is useful if a formula in the current "
"worksheet depends on a cell in a different workbook. "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> will not necessarily know when that data"
" has been updated so a user can force <application>Gnumeric</application> to"
" recalculate all the cells in the current workbook."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Räkna om</guimenuitem> — Menyobjektet <guimenuitem>Räkna "
"om</guimenuitem> tvingar arbetsboken att räkna om resultaten. Det är "
"användbart om en formel i det aktuella kalkylbladet är beroende av en cell i"
" en annan arbetsbok. <application>Gnumeric</application> märker inte alltid "
"när dessa data har uppdaterats, så du kan tvinga "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> att räkna om alla celler i den aktuella "
"arbetsboken."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1055
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Preferences...</guimenuitem> — The "
"<guimenuitem>Preference...</guimenuitem> menu item calls the "
"<guilabel><application>Gnumeric</application> Preferences</guilabel> dialog "
"explained in detail in <xref linkend=\"chapter-configuring\"/>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Inställningar…</guimenuitem> — Menyobjektet "
"<guimenuitem>Inställningar…</guimenuitem> öppnar dialogrutan "
"<guilabel>Inställningar för <application>Gnumeric</application></guilabel>, "
"som beskrivs närmare i <xref linkend=\"chapter-configuring\"/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1082
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/menu-view-labelled.png\"/> "
"</imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the View menu.</phrase> "
"</textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/menu-view-labelled.png\"/> "
"</imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av menyn Visa.</phrase> "
"</textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1114
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>New View...</guimenuitem> — The <guimenuitem>New "
"View...</guimenuitem> menu item opens up a new window with the current "
"workbook visible. and where both windows are open to the same section of the"
" workbook. If the user starts editing a different part of the sheet in one "
"view, the other view moves automatically to that portion of the worksheet. "
"Similarly, if the user changes to a different worksheet in one view, the "
"other view changes also."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Ny vy…</guimenuitem> — Menyobjektet <guimenuitem>Ny "
"vy…</guimenuitem> öppnar ett nytt fönster med den aktuella arbetsboken. Båda"
" fönstren visar samma del av arbetsboken. Om du börjar redigera en annan del"
" av kalkylbladet i den ena vyn flyttas den andra automatiskt till samma del."
" Om du byter till ett annat kalkylblad i den ena vyn byter även den andra "
"vyn kalkylblad."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1129
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Freeze Panes</guimenuitem> — The <guimenuitem>Freeze "
"Panes</guimenuitem> menu item is used to freeze the top-most and leftmost "
"visible portion of the worksheet. This is useful to be able to line up "
"portions of the worksheet which are not usually together. For instance, if a"
" user had a very large table with the titles of each column of data on row "
"12, the user could select row 13 and select this menu item. If the user "
"scrolled through each data row, the data would line up underneath each "
"header."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Frys paneler</guimenuitem> — Menyobjektet <guimenuitem>Frys "
"paneler</guimenuitem> låser den översta och vänstra synliga delen av "
"kalkylbladet. Då kan du hålla ihop delar av kalkylbladet som annars inte "
"visas samtidigt. Om du till exempel har en stor tabell med kolumnrubriker på"
" rad 12 kan du markera rad 13 och välja det här menyobjektet. När du sedan "
"rullar genom raderna ligger data kvar under respektive rubrik."
